        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is related to VRChat testing Cloudflare spectrum for DDoS protection purposes (this was announced on the official Discord server as \"server adjustments\" and recently also just \"maintenance\" along with a note that you won't be able to see other players in instances). Most of the random connection timeouts/resets are caused by traffic being rerouted to a different datacenter and Spectrum being a product that requires active stateful connection tracking, which Cloudflare isn't doing across different datacenters for performance reasons.\nThose random disconnects should be happening less often right now since Cloudflare Spectrum is disabled again as of writing this comment.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
